# rasayan — src/etc.cyr: Rust 1.2.0's electron transport chain tests, ported
# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml
#
# The 24 unit tests of `etc.rs` and the 3 integration tests (tests/integration.rs) that call only glycolysis, TCA and
# the ETC, as they are written; tests/golden/etc.tsv checks every method, single step, trajectory and Rust's full
# respiration pipeline besides. Beyond them: the trace event, the crate-private step with its drive, Complex I's
# capacity, accumulate, the complex-rate view and the codecs' refusals.

